  "body": "We value your privacy\n\nWe use cookies to enhance your browsing experience, serve personalized ads or content, and analyze our traffic. By clicking \"Accept All\", you consent to our use of cookies. Cookie Policy\n\nCustomize\nReject All\nAccept All\n01332 413373\nCall Now\[REDACTED_EMAIL]\nSupport e-mail\nMon-Fri 08:00 AM - 16:30 PM\nSat & Sun CLOSED\nGarden Maintenance\nPlanting Design\nSoft Landscaping\n   Covering Derby & Nottingham Areas\n\nProud members of Derbyshire Trusted Trader since 2017 — backed by over 140 five-star reviews.\n\nLed by Chartered horticulturist Jonathan Gregory BSc (Hons), MHort — delivering specialist care for established gardens.\n\nEnvironment Agency licensed for compliant green waste removal, and fully insured when working on your property.\n\nEnvironment Agency licensed for compliant green waste removal, and fully insured when working on your property.\n\n Garden Maintenance and Care for Larger Gardens & Grounds in Derby & Nearby\nYour Garden — In Knowledgeable, Safe Hands.\n\n✅\nExperienced Horticultural Team\n\nLed by a Chartered horticulturist.\n\n✅\nSpecialists in Established Gardens\n\nTailored care for mature borders and planting.\n\n✅\nReliable Scheduled Garden Maintenance\n\nConsistency and high standards on every visit.\n\n✅\nSeasonal Pruning to Full Border Restoration\n\nComprehensive plant care throughout the year.\n\nSee What Our Customers Say\nEXCELLENT\nBased on 114 reviews\nBeverley Sanders\n07/08/2026\nCould not fault John and his team when they did a complete reset/overhaul of my uncles large garden. They worked tirelessly in very difficult conditions and the results were amazing. Thank you to john and his team!\nIan Lindsay (I4n)\n27/07/2026\nEmployed Garden Rangers to restructure the trees & bushes in my garden. Quote and all communications were very clear & good. Turned up promptly and completed the work to a high standard exactly as agreed. Team were all very professional & courteous and at the end of the job they fully cleared all up to a high standard. Very happy with the work & approach - very professional and would highly recommend them.\nMad Mole\n22/07/2026\nThank you so much to John and all the team, you truly went above and beyond, and we both can’t thank you enough. From the very first call to the moment the work was completed, everything was an absolute breeze. Their workmanship is meticulous, reliable, and carried out with real pride. The whole team are friendly, hardworking, and always leave the garden looking immaculate. It’s such a relief to have people who genuinely care about the job they do. Highly recommended. Best wishes, J & B\nRebecca Skinner\n07/07/2026\nSteve did a fantastic job preparing ground then laying our modest size lawn in the heat So so happy with how it looks Thank you!\nMatt Harris\n29/06/2026\nWe couldn’t be happier with the work carried out by Garden Rangers. They completely transformed our tired, worn-out garden into a beautiful outdoor space that we can finally enjoy. From the initial consultation through to t",
